1
00:00:00,923 --> 00:00:02,453
(Sheldon:)Look, I'm sorry.

2
00:00:02,458 --> 00:00:05,058
(Sheldon:)Tell me why
Bernadette is upset with you.

3
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:07,860
(Penny:)Well, I told people at work
that she's pregnant.

4
00:00:07,863 --> 00:00:09,933
(Penny:)She wasn't ready
for them to know.

5
00:00:09,932 --> 00:00:11,402
(Sheldon:)Why would you do that?

6
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:13,470
(Penny:)Well, it just slipped out.
I feel terrible.

7
00:00:13,469 --> 00:00:15,569
(Sheldon:)See, that's exactly
what happened to me,

8
00:00:15,571 --> 00:00:18,801
(Sheldon:)except that I said it on
purpose, and I have no regrets.

9
00:00:21,076 --> 00:00:23,476
(Raj:)Is it even possible
to get this done in two months?

10
00:00:23,479 --> 00:00:25,309
(Howard:)Well, maybe. I don't know.
We'll have to work

11
00:00:25,314 --> 00:00:27,444
(Howard:)12 hours a day,
seven days a week.

12
00:00:27,449 --> 00:00:30,249
(Leonard:)Which means I won't be able to
make Penny breakfast every day,

13
00:00:30,252 --> 00:00:31,852
(Leonard:)and she'll realize
my brioche French toast

14
00:00:31,854 --> 00:00:34,724
(Leonard:)was the only thing
keeping her in the marriage.

15
00:00:34,723 --> 00:00:36,323
(Howard:)I love your
French toast.

16
00:00:36,325 --> 00:00:37,725
(Leonard:)Oh, thanks, man.

17
00:00:37,726 --> 00:00:41,796
(Raj:)So, why did you guys
even agree to the deadline?

18
00:00:41,797 --> 00:00:43,367
(Howard:)We didn't. Sheldon did.

19
00:00:43,365 --> 00:00:44,495
(Raj:)And you just let him?

20
00:00:44,497 --> 00:00:47,337
(Leonard:)Well, the colonel said it was
for the good of the country,

21
00:00:47,336 --> 00:00:48,466
(Leonard:)and the funding
is substantial.

22
00:00:48,470 --> 00:00:50,170
(Howard:)No, but mostly, there
was an awkward pause,

23
00:00:50,172 --> 00:00:53,172
(Howard:)and I broke it
by saying, "Okay."

24
00:00:53,175 --> 00:00:57,315
(Raj:)So I guess I won't be
seeing you guys for a while.

25
00:00:57,313 --> 00:00:58,503
(Leonard:)Oh, looks like it.

26
00:00:58,530 --> 00:00:59,480
(Raj:)Wow.

27
00:00:59,481 --> 00:01:02,251
(Raj:)You're going off to work with
the military, leaving me behind.

